#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0012 expect=skipped domain=DM
#note "The cdisc-family ACCESSOR-LEVEL provider-absent LIBRARY skip pin (once per mechanism in this batch; operation-level sibling pin on CDISC-CG0014). NO #library line of ANY kind. The rule's only library reads are the var_type(\"LIBRARY\") accessor and its non_empty guard - no Operations - so the skip must come from RuleRunner's needed-metadata-levels check (MetadataLevel.LIBRARY needed, provider null -> SKIPPED). Uses the invalid body's DM with AGE declared type=Char (discriminating)."
dataset DM label="Demographics"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col AGE     type=Char label="Age"
col AGEU    type=Char label="Age Units"
col SEX     type=Char label="Sex"
---
S1 | 001 | 56 | YEARS | M
